# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
cleanenv/
# All throwaway validation venvs -- glob, not one entry per venv.
# Release validation creates several (.venv-validation, .venv-postpublish,
# .venv-jup, ...); adding them one at a time meant `git add -A` swept two
# of them into the index during the v4.2.0 release.
.venv-*/
.release-venv/
cleanenv/
.release-smoke/

# Test cache
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/

# Build artifacts
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Nodus runtime data
.nodus/

# Virtual environment 
.venv/

# Claude Code
.claude/
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/commands/*.md

# Audit reports
AUDIT_REPORT*.md
DOCS_AUDIT_REPORT*.md

# Planning and evaluation documents (working files, not part of the repo)
Session Handoff Summary*.md
docs/history/plans/V3_0_PLAN.md
CAPTURE RELEASE PLAYBOOK.md
DOCS AUDIT TASK.md
EVAL_LOG.md
P0 BLOCKER FIXES.md
PYPI RELEASE.md
STRESS-TEST USER EVALUATION*

# Where those documents go once they stop being current. Ignored as a directory
# rather than relying on the patterns above to follow their files: every one of
# them happens to be unanchored, so moving the v2.0.0-era audits and task prompts
# here left them ignored by coincidence rather than by design. The next document
# dropped in here will match none of those names, and would become committable
# with no signal at all -- in a public repo, which is not a reversible sort of
# mistake. This directory is local; nothing in it is part of the repo.
docs/archive/

# Artifacts written into the repo root by `nodus_gate --runtime` when it executes
# the file-writing examples in docs/guide/standard-library.md. Regenerated on every
# gate run; never meant to be committed. (tmp_demo/ is already excluded from the CI
# fmt check for the same reason.)
notes.txt
output.json
header.bin
tmp_demo/

# Full pytest output from tools/check_dependent_suites.py, one file per companion.
# Written so a red Gate 10 can be triaged without re-running the suite (#528);
# machine-local by nature.
.dependent-suites/
.opcode-census.json
